fluentd: Collect the nova_libvirt virtlogd log

nova_libvirt now writes virtlogd's log to
/var/log/kolla/libvirt/virtlogd.log, but the libvirt tail source only
follows libvirtd.log, so check-logs.sh reports the file as missing.
Add it to the source; both files use libvirt's log format.

virtlogd creates its log readable only by root, and the permissions
glob in nova-libvirt's config.json only matches files that already
exist when kolla_set_configs runs, so on a fresh deploy fluentd cannot
open the file. Create it in config.json as root:kolla 0664, as is
already done for libvirtd.log.

Prompt: diagnose why Zuul failed every kolla-ansible deploy job on kolla
change 1010516.

